.TH EXPORT_FROM_CHUNKS 1 2026-10月 "" "A pre-defined list of the image locations"
.SH NAME
export_from_chunks \- export_from_chunks(wavFile, output.dir,
    <i>size</i> = image_pixel_size,
    <i>lines</i> = image_scan_lines,
    <i>smooth</i> = <span style='color: green;'>0</span>,
    <i>report</i> = <span style='color: blue !important;'>FALSE</span>)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIexport_from_chunks(wavFile, output.dir,
    <i>size</i> = image_pixel_size,
    <i>lines</i> = image_scan_lines,
    <i>smooth</i> = <span style='color: green;'>0</span>,
    <i>report</i> = <span style='color: blue !important;'>FALSE</span>)\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
the frame length of an image data section, the calibration circle image
section is about 1928181 sample frames long
the pixel cells (the image rows) inside a single scan line
the number of the scan lines (the image columns) of a single image
make batch export of the images on the disk
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBwavFile\fB \fR\- . the file path to the disk image in wave file
.PP
.PP
\fBoutput.dir\fB \fR\- . 
.PP
.PP
\fBsize\fB \fR\- image_pixel_size. the pixel cells (the image rows) inside a single scan line
.PP
.PP
\fBlines\fB \fR\- image_scan_lines. the number of the scan lines (the image columns)
.PP
.PP
\fBsmooth\fB \fR\- 0. the radius of the across scan line smoothing
.PP
.PP
\fBreport\fB \fR\- FALSE. print the empirical analysis report of every image section
.PP
.SH FILES
.PP
SMRUCC/R#.declare_function.export_from_chunks at chunks.R:line 28
.PP
